/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (Forge & Flow is a forward thinking software company designed specifically for the restaurant industry, merging technology and industry expertise to create a unique KPI dashboard and learning center. This software seamlessly integrates with existing POS systems and other technology solutions, such as reservation and scheduling apps.  By harnessing 60 days of data, Forge & Flow calculates benchmark targets that empower operators to make informed, proactive decisions. This approach shifts the focus from instinct-driven choices to data-backed strategies, enhancing operational efficiency and improving overall guest experiences.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
