236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (What sets Forge & Flow apart is its commitment to empowering restaurant operators with real-time insights that encourage a proactive approach to management. By providing comprehensive visibility into not just labor percentages, but also the myriad factors influencing them, operators can engage in more strategic planning and resource allocation. This data-driven framework allows them to meet labor needs while enhancing service quality.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (One of the standout features of Forge & Flow is its commitment to staff development through accessible training material. The platform enables operators to provide on-the-fly access to training resources, ensuring that staff can find the information they need when they need it. This streamlines the training process and creates a culture of continuous learning and improvement. By equipping employees with the knowledge and skills to excel, restaurants can elevate their service quality and create memorable guest experiences.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
