244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (Forge & Flow was born out of a pressing challenge faced by our restaurant management team. As we oversaw multiple locations, a common struggle emerged: how could managers effectively be on the floor making critical decisions while simultaneously gathering and analyzing the data required to inform those decisions? The reality was that many were left to rely on gut feelings and educated guesses, leading to inconsistencies in decision-making processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (One of the more daunting challenges was maintaining labor percentages in alignment with the owners' expectations. Managers frequently found themselves caught in a cycle of burnout, trying to meet unrealistic targets without compromising the quality of the guest experience. The ongoing turnover in restaurant staff became an all-too-familiar pattern, with employees leaving due to feelings of being overworked and underappreciated. As managers devoted themselves to keeping everyone happy, they often neglected their own well-being, leaving them overwhelmed and trapped in a system that felt increasingly unsustainable.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (In response to these challenges, we resorted to creating spreadsheets that pulled data from various sources, including payroll, POS, and reservation systems, to calculate the data needed for deeper insight. While these numbers provided some insight into performance and helped identify trends, they often came too late to enact meaningful change and the manual input of data was time-consuming. Recognizing the urgent need for a more efficient solution, we developed a real-time dashboard that empowers managers to access critical information at their fingertips. With this tool, they can easily monitor guest spending, anticipate cover counts, and evaluate team productivity - all in real time. By streamlining access to essential data, Forge & Flow transforms the way our managers operate, enabling them to make informed decisions without sacrificing their presence on the floor or the well-being of their staff.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
