/T (BENCHMARK Under your benchmark tab, you will find a clear benchmark for each Key Performance Indicator \(KPI\), providing you with a reliable baseline of data to guide your operational decisions. This baseline is established by pulling in 60 days' worth of data from your Point of Sale \(POS\) system, ensuring that your performance metrics are grounded in recent, relevant trends. Every 60 days, your targets will shift, allowing for adjustments that take into account various factors such as optimization efforts, seasonal fluctuations, and even changes in weather conditions. This structured approach enables you to maintain a consistent set of KPIs over a two-month period, minimizing the potential for confusion or volatility that can arise from constantly shifting targets.)
/E (BENCHMARK Under your benchmark tab, you will find a clear benchmark for each Key Performance Indicator \(KPI\), providing you with a reliable baseline of data to guide your operational decisions. This baseline is established by pulling in 60 days' worth of data from your Point of Sale \(POS\) system, ensuring that your performance metrics are grounded in recent, relevant trends. Every 60 days, your targets will shift, allowing for adjustments that take into account various factors such as optimization efforts, seasonal fluctuations, and even changes in weather conditions. This structured approach enables you to maintain a consistent set of KPIs over a two-month period, minimizing the potential for confusion or volatility that can arise from constantly shifting targets.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
