/T (AGILITY AND SPEED  As a small team, we thrive on our ability to pivot, iterate, and launch updates at an impressive pace, setting us apart from larger competitors. Our close-knit structure allows for direct and rapid communication, enabling us to prioritize speed, flexibility, and responsiveness. With fewer approval layers in place, we can react quickly to market changes and customer feedback, fostering an environment of continuous improvement and aligned vision. Each team member plays a vital role, resulting in heightened motivation and a shared commitment to fast problem-solving. This agile approach empowers us to take calculated risks and learn from small setbacks, all while larger corporations often find themselves encumbered by complex hierarchies that can stifle innovation.)
