439 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 220 0 R
/T (SUPERIOR USER EXPERIENCE  With a deep understanding of how operators work, our app is crafted specifically from a restaurant operator's perspective, ensuring ease of use for all team members. Features designed by techies rather than operators are often too complex, leading to low usage and high frustration. Our intuitive design allows users to quickly find the information they need, enabling them to adapt swiftly to changing circumstances. The app offers quick access to essential training materials and standard operating procedures \(SOPs\), ensuring that every staff member has the information necessary to complete tasks accurately. With the ability to rapidly update training materials and disseminate them to the entire team, the app eliminates the need for traditional printing, promoting efficiency and consistency. Not only does the app provide valuable feedback on operations, but it also generates data-driven solutions based on collected insights, alleviating the burden on managers to analyze and troubleshoot on their own. Additionally, the option for customized branding allows restaurants to incorporate their own logos, colors, and photos, personalizing the experience and reinforcing their identity - all while having the app named after their establishment for effortless recognition. )
/E (SUPERIOR USER EXPERIENCE  With a deep understanding of how operators work, our app is crafted specifically from a restaurant operator's perspective, ensuring ease of use for all team members. Features designed by techies rather than operators are often too complex, leading to low usage and high frustration. Our intuitive design allows users to quickly find the information they need, enabling them to adapt swiftly to changing circumstances. The app offers quick access to essential training materials and standard operating procedures \(SOPs\), ensuring that every staff member has the information necessary to complete tasks accurately. With the ability to rapidly update training materials and disseminate them to the entire team, the app eliminates the need for traditional printing, promoting efficiency and consistency. Not only does the app provide valuable feedback on operations, but it also generates data-driven solutions based on collected insights, alleviating the burden on managers to analyze and troubleshoot on their own. Additionally, the option for customized branding allows restaurants to incorporate their own logos, colors, and photos, personalizing the experience and reinforcing their identity - all while having the app named after their establishment for effortless recognition. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
