448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 221 0 R
/E (While we are currently able to integrate with multiple POS systems, the landscape is diverse, with many older models still in operation. These older, closed-loop, on-premise systems often lack the necessary cloud connectivity to interface with modern applications, ultimately functioning in isolation and making it challenging to incorporate third-party tools. Additionally, they frequently fall short of regular security updates and may not adhere to current PCI DSS compliance standards, rendering them vulnerable to data breaches and fraud. This creates a limitation in our ability to collaborate with restaurants that have not yet upgraded their POS systems. Although our app may not encompass every feature available, we pride ourselves on our focused approach, delivering exceptional data integration with top solutions. While many tech companies offer all-in-one solutions, they often spread their resources too thin, resulting in subpar development for each feature. Instead, we emphasize delivering tangible results, implementing features in stages rather than overwhelming our clients with a "big bang" approach. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
