/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 223 0 R
/E (Current market trends in tech solutions for restaurants are increasingly focused on harnessing the power of artificial intelligence to enhance operational efficiency and guest experience. Demand forecasting has emerged as a crucial tool for restaurants, leveraging AI to accurately predict guest needs and optimize staffing, thereby reducing operational costs. The rise of unified, all-in-one platforms promises simplicity but often comes with drawbacks, as they can be complex to manage and lack the specialized performance of dedicated solutions. Our app addresses these challenges by creating data-driven forecasts and benchmarks based on 60 days of POS data and reservation activity, allowing managers to make informed decisions on scheduling and operations in real time. The integration of CRM \(Customer Reputation Management\) scores alongside operational data allows for quick trend analysis, linking customer spending patterns and productivity to guest satisfaction in a coherent manner. Unlike other all-in-one solutions that can compromise quality for convenience, our app offers seamless integration with the best technologies tailored to individual needs, presenting data in a streamlined format that enhances operational efficiency for restaurant owners.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
