487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (In addition to addressing guest engagement, the restaurant sector faces another pressing challenge: high staff turnover. Onboarding and training new employees can be a daunting task, leading many establishments to grapple with untrained staff and the negative consequences that follow. Learning Management Systems \(LMS\) are emerging as a valuable solution, allowing for easy updates to training materials, testing, and tracking employee progress. However, the high costs of implementing such systems often lead restaurants to forgo them altogether, perpetuating a cycle of inadequate training and turnover. Our solution offers an LMS at a more approachable rate, complete with standard operating procedure \(SOP\) templates and stock training manuals, offering another solution to free management from administrative tasks to put their focus where it is most needed.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [2]
>>
