/P 229 0 R
/E (In today's rapidly evolving restaurant landscape, operators face the challenge of navigating a myriad of technology solutions tailored to streamline their operations. Our app emerges as a complementary tool designed to enhance the functionality of existing systems rather than directly competing with current solutions. While many solutions focus solely on individual functionalities, our app is designed to integrate various tech solutions into one cohesive platform, making it easier for restaurant operators to access and manage the information that drives their business without having to do a costly overhaul of their current tech stack.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 229 0 R
/E (Our target market comprises a diverse range of restaurants eager to select their preferred technology solutions. These operators appreciate the importance of customizing systems to fit their unique operational needs while still wanting the convenience of consolidated reporting. For those currently committed to multiple tech solutions, perhaps locked into contracts, our app offers a seamless way to retain their existing systems without sacrificing accessibility to critical data. By centralizing reporting in one location, we alleviate the burden of juggling various platforms, allowing operators to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional dining experiences.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
493 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 229 0 R
/E (Additionally, we aim to engage high-level operators and clients of Benchmark Sixty - those who take a modern and proactive approach to data analytics within their establishments. Our app provides insights into key performance indicators such as Cost Per Labor Hour \(CPLH\), Sales Per Labor Hour \(SPLH\), and blended wage metrics, setting us apart from other providers in the industry. By analyzing these data points, operators can make informed decisions that drive their business forward.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
494 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 229 0 R
/E (Furthermore, our app serves as a comprehensive training solution for restaurants aiming to enhance their staff development. By centralizing training materials, offering direct performance feedback, and providing customizable training manuals and Standard Operating Procedures \(SOPs\), we enable restaurants to elevate their staff training without the need to start from scratch. )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
