/Title (PLATFORM FRAGMENTATION  Restaurants today often find themselves navigating a maze of disconnected software providers and systems, leading to inefficient workflows that can hinder success. The high fees associated with multiple platforms, paired with operational inefficiencies, can significantly strain profit margins, making it understandable for restaurant owners to hesitate when considering the addition of new solutions to their tech stack. This hesitation can create barriers to seamlessly integrating existing technology, and complicates the integration process. Navigating the myriad of tech solutions available can inadvertently increase our team's workload, as we face the challenge of integrating multiple disparate systems that often lack seamless communication, ultimately complicating our efforts to generate accurate and cohesive data.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1512 0 R
/Next 857 0 R
>>
endobj
