<<
/Title (LACK OF IT SUPPORT STRATEGY  As we continue to develop our app, we recognize that formulating a robust IT support strategy for our future clients has not yet been a priority. However, we understand the potential pitfalls of lacking in-house IT expertise, such as slow bug fixes, unmanaged software updates, and extended downtime, which can detract from our focus on scaling the business. Without dedicated IT support, founders often find themselves grappling with technical debt and urgent repairs, creating a stressful work environment that can hinder growth. To proactively address this challenge, we are committed to establishing a solid IT support structure with an in-house team, ensuring that we bring on the right talent with the necessary skill sets. This thoughtful approach will empower us to guide our clients effectively from day one, providing clear actions and contact points to streamline their experience and enhance overall satisfaction.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1690 0 R
/Next 1686 0 R
>>
