/Title (DEPENDENCY ON KEY STAFF As a startup, we recognize the immense value of key team members in driving our vision forward. However, we also understand that when vital knowledge - such as proprietary code and system architecture - resides solely with one individual, it introduces significant risks, including potential development delays and business disruptions if that person becomes unavailable. This reliance can limit our capacity for growth and innovation, potentially leading to burnout. To mitigate these challenges, we are proactively documenting our processes, system architecture, and codebases to secure essential intellectual property. We are also committed to building a diverse team with overlapping skills, ensuring that knowledge is shared and everyone can contribute to our mission.)
/Dest [34 0 R /Fit]
